    <Name>INT_2016_0081</Name>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2016_0081","fieldKey":"title"} -->
    <Title>On why the canvas must stay blank</Title>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2016_0081","fieldKey":"date"} -->
    <Date>2016-10-26</Date>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2016_0081","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Ömer Haddad talks about how to hang a painting upside down on purpose. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as "…".</Description>
